      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SYNTHESISE (1) is the clear top pick despite coming off a five-month spell. Opened last prep with an eye-catching second over 1400m at Morphettville Parks then contested four stakes races, the highlight a third in the Listed Claire Lindop. Has a massive class edge and should pack too much for this field. The main threat is STRONG MINDED (2) who ended a run of four minor placings on wet tracks with a win on a good deck over this course and distance a fortnight ago. Not in the same league as SYNTHESISE but is match fit. TESTING ONE TWO (3) has not handled a sand track and a heavy track since a nice return here three back. TOUR DE MOON (4) returned to form when just outside the placings over 1500m at Gawler recently. Back in trip but should be competitive again. MY CHERIE AMOR (5) can bounce back after finding 1000m at Murray Bridge too sharp last start. HELL'S ON FIRE (6) has been well found in early markets - blinkers going on might be driving that support.",
